# Internal API of the Indexing Service (contract: api/indexing-openapi.yaml).
# Needs docker-compose.validation.yml, which publishes the port. How to run: http/README.md.

### Status of the service
# Expected: 200, indexing-service
GET {{indexing}}/status

### Status of the index
# Expected: 200, books_indexed 15, published_version 1, books_published 15
GET {{indexing}}/index/status

### Index a book: not in the datalake
# Expected: 404 NOT_FOUND
POST {{indexing}}/index/update/999999

### Index a book: invalid id
# Expected: 400 INVALID_PARAMETER, field book_id
POST {{indexing}}/index/update/abc

### Publish: not implemented until DR-08
# Expected: 501 NOT_IMPLEMENTED. After DR-08, right after loading the dataset:
# 200, version 1, books_published 0, total_books 15, and no new version
POST {{indexing}}/index/publish

### Rebuild: not implemented until DR-10
# Expected: 501 NOT_IMPLEMENTED
POST {{indexing}}/index/rebuild
